      "message": "docs(site): reference for the multi-axis, probing and plasma operations\n\nOne section per multi-axis kind in the registry (5-Axis Contour, 5-Axis\nParallel, 5-Axis Flow, Multi-Axis Contour, Swarf, Advanced Swarf, Rotary\nContour, Rotary Parallel, Rotary Offset, Multi-Axis Rough) with the shared\npose trio, shank avoidance, the in-air swing rule and the machine's reach\ncheck; a Probe page (picks, tabs, what the post writes, the stylus guards);\na Plasma Profile page (kerf, direction, leads, small holes, the plasma\ntable, torch and post it needs, and the plasma laws). Linked from the\noperations page.\n\nRefs #1250\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
